-18T18:02:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687676","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956450-1846018067940332","game_id":"steam-4956450","kind":"update","title":"Lanelord Demo Update 1 - The Quality of Life just got better!","summary":"First update is now live!What has been changed? New features:1. Turorial:Since my game seems to be confusing at first I implemented a Tutorial that shows what can be done. Yes! You ARE the road in solo escort!2. Skin Setups for car and road:You can now save your whole skin/color/item setup in one of 5 save slots within the customization menu and even give it a name.3. You can now see what killed you... AWESOME!At the end of the round you can now hide the game over window to see what killed you.T","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T08:39:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940332","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4956450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:21Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:20Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4956450":"2026-10-26T05:34:21Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4956450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:20Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:20Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4979110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4956450","app_id":4956450,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:11Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR",